From: Technology Innovation Institute
Subject: [PATCH] platform/sel4: Add hypervisor ftrace control driver

Add a built-in driver that provides an interface to control seL4
kernel ftrace from guest Linux. The driver maps a fixed MMIO region
and provides hyp_ftrace_arm() and hyp_ftrace_dump() functions.

Uses postcore_initcall to ensure it initializes before complex
drivers like BPMP, allowing ftrace to capture early boot activity.

Signed-off-by: Technology Innovation Institute
---
